@ Home screen: codes, selected index, first visible row, labels -> 131x64 GROB.
@ The header's right side and the countdown are drawn by HTICK.
@ Rows: 5 visible, 8 px each from y=12; the selected one is inverted.
\<< \-> codes sel top lbls
  \<<
    #131d #64d BLANK
    { #0d #0d } "TOTP" 2 \->GROB REPL
    IF ACCTS SIZE 0 == THEN
      "No accounts yet:" 20 CTXT "press ADD" 30 CTXT
    ELSE
      top top 4 + ACCTS SIZE MIN FOR k
        #131d #8d BLANK
        { #2d #0d } ACCTS k GET 1 GET 2 \->GROB REPL
        { #87d #0d } codes k GET FMT7 2 \->GROB REPL
        IF k sel == THEN NEG END
        k top - 8 * 12 + R\->B #0d SWAP 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
      NEXT
    END
    { #0d #56d } lbls REPL
  \>>
\>>
